{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/samana-park-meadows-samana-developers-dubailand","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1105,"crm_id":"3021","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Samana Park Meadows","slug":"samana-park-meadows-samana-developers-dubailand","display_address":"Dubailand","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2028","developer":"Samana Developers","price":null,"display_price":"","lattitude":25.0906799,"longitude":55.3841731,"min_bedrooms":0,"max_bedrooms":0,"display_bedrooms":"TBA","about":"<p>Samana Park Meadows is a high-rise residential development by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-samana-developers/\">Samana Developers</a> in the vibrant neighborhood of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubailand/\">Dubailand</a>, Dubai.</p><p>Samana Park Meadows serves as a great option for your residence or investment due to its combination of comfort, modernity and simplicity. Inside, you will find open, spacious spaces designed for relaxation and comfort, with elegant finishes and a serene atmosphere.</p><p>The project aims to offer residents a fully realized living environment through amenities such as: sports courts, jogging tracks and swimming pools, community centers, fitness centers that include well-equipped gyms and green recreational areas.</p><p>One of the key advantages of the complex is its strategic location in a rapidly developing neighborhood. Thus, within 10 - 15 minutes one can reach Global Village, Dubai Outlet Mall, IMG World and Fairgreen International School. Mirdif City Center, Dubai Airport, Dubai Mall and Miracle Garden are all within 15 - 20 minutes. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/downtown-dubai/\">Dubai Downtown</a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/burj-khalifa/\">Burj Khalifa</a> can be reached in 20 - 25 minutes.</p><p>Samana Park Meadows is not just a place to live, it is a lifestyle choice that promises comfort, luxury and growth.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/3021/images/2024/09/11/LfDxCv8NhhnjysP4tc2IYYlAnNMdgmxJHorSnREU.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/09/11/LfDxCv8NhhnjysP4tc2IYYlAnNMdgmxJHorSnREU.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/3021/images/2024/09/11/vHe2nhVgWS3k2zfMlQK1PiVWS8NT9wh6FYZgxTZD.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/09/11/vHe2nhVgWS3k2zfMlQK1PiVWS8NT9wh6FYZgxTZD.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/3021/images/2024/09/11/HStuQYQG6P3Y5JqhfvSEPR9qrIGk8bXQwHYKnBcJ.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/09/11/HStuQYQG6P3Y5JqhfvSEPR9qrIGk8bXQwHYKnBcJ.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/3021/images/2024/09/11/099SpDwCqFrGUQiNQQbnJBcoh0l0nsgQt6px8P24.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/09/11/099SpDwCqFrGUQiNQQbnJBcoh0l0nsgQt6px8P24.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/3021/images/2024/09/11/bmzgTI42J1DP5QKQ9k7uTPNYCWrXAq3GbvCactSy.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/09/11/bmzgTI42J1DP5QKQ9k7uTPNYCWrXAq3GbvCactSy.jpg","__ggfxIndex":4},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/3021/images/2024/09/11/KAL1w7t7OYnXIv5nlukJLfe2WrPM5wwW1QjICg6C.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/09/11/KAL1w7t7OYnXIv5nlukJLfe2WrPM5wwW1QjICg6C.jpg","__ggfxIndex":5},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/